ype-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr400"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 9%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/dfasgfgihw/"></a><br><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/bssPhr401/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="401" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr401"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 9%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/dfasww314h/"></a><br><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/bssPhr402/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="402" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr402"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 9%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/dfasikgo0g/"></a><br><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/bssPhr403/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="403" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr403"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 9%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/dfasxk7dmg/"></a><br><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/bssPhr404/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="404" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr404"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 13%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/dfasi9hn60/"></a><br><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/bssPhr405/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="405" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr405"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/bssPhr406/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="406" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr406"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/dfasy4sygo/"></a>Комиссия, назначенная приказом N _____ от &#34;__&#34; _________ 20___ г., осмотрела транспортное средство __________________ (марка) модели _________ типа _________ номер двигателя _________ государственный номерной знак ___________________.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/bssPhr407/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="407" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr407"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/dfas34gnf5/"></a>В результате осмотра __________________ (марка), его агрегатов, частей и механизмов и ознакомления с документами (паспортом, формуляром) комиссия установила:</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/bssPhr408/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="408" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr408"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/dfas7rxigv/"></a>1. Поступило в организацию &#34;___&#34; _______ 20___ г.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/bssPhr409/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="409" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr409"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/dfasz65zsv/"></a>2. Вес основного средства по паспорту __________.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/bssPhr410/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="410" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr410"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/dfas3xvyrz/"></a>3. Сведения о наличии годных частей, деталей, материалов, цветных и драгоценных металлов и пр.</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdAll" colspan="3" style="width: 10%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/bssPhr411/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="411" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr411"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/dfasae7zbq/"></a><strong>Номер</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="width: 28%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/bssPhr412/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="412" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr412"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/dfasbfwtit/"></a><strong>Наименование</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="width: 12%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/bssPhr413/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="413" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr413"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/dfas0habl2/"></a><strong>Единица</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/bssPhr414/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="414" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr414"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/dfas2vbxm4/"></a><strong>измерения</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="width: 12%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/bssPhr415/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="415" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr415"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/dfasd5ogd0/"></a><strong>Количество</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="width: 12%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/bssPhr416/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="416" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr416"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/dfasasc99d/"></a><strong>Оценка</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="width: 12%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/bssPhr417/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="417" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr417"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/dfas8fhkgk/"></a><strong>Сумма</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 10%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/bssPhr418/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="418" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr418"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/dfas04kqxt/"></a><strong>по порядку</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 10%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/bssPhr419/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="419" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr419"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/dfasef59bt/"></a><strong>по каталогу</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 10%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/bssPhr420/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="420" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr420"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/dfas9d0bvo/"></a><strong>номенклатура</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 10%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/dfaseer6gh/"></a><br><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/bssPhr421/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="421" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr421"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 10%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/dfas2tpf88/"></a><br><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/bssPhr422/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="422" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr422"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 10%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/bssPhr423/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="423" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr423"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17848/dfasgrzim2/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 